Subject: python3-vcs-versioning: add VCS_VERSIONING_PRETEND_VERSION_FOR_VCS_VERSIONING

Companion to 0008. Patch 0007 set the SETUPTOOLS_SCM_PRETEND_VERSION
variant; confirmed to reach the sandbox but ignored by vcs-versioning's
own backend, which uses the VCS_VERSIONING_* env namespace. Build 9vclb
still ran git describe --match 'vcs-versioning-*' and hit the 40s
subprocess timeout.

Add the VCS_VERSIONING_* equivalent. Version matches the element's ref
(vcs-versioning-v2.6.0-0-gfa5c2319...).

